<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#2B4A45', padding: '24px 72px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 104, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 3, height: 34, background: '#A8402F' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F1E8', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                六个数字，都是当场量出来的
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.5, marginTop: 8, letterSpacing: 1, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                不是目标值，是这台机器上跑出来的结果
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 508, flexDirection: 'row', flexWrap: 'wrap', gap: 26 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 358, height: 240, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderLeft: '3px solid #A8402F', paddingLeft: 22 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 74, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F1E8', lineHeight: 1, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    171
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.7, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    MB
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F1E8', marginTop: 12, fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                单文件，双击就跑
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.62, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                页面、模型、语音、主题包都在这个 exe 里，不装环境、不下载依赖。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 358, height: 240, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderLeft: '3px solid #A8402F', paddingLeft: 22 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 74, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F1E8', lineHeight: 1, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    0
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.7, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    个解释器
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F1E8', marginTop: 12, fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                运行时不加载 Python
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.62, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                整个程序是一个 Rust 进程。没有解释器可崩，也不会被隐藏的 .bat 兜一圈。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 358, height: 240, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderLeft: '3px solid #A8402F', paddingLeft: 22 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 74, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F1E8', lineHeight: 1, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    30
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.7, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    条
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F1E8', marginTop: 12, fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                知识条目，逐条可校对
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.62, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                六个展项，每项一段讲解稿、一段深讲、三条问答。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 358, height: 240, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderLeft: '3px solid #A8402F', paddingLeft: 22 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 74, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F1E8', lineHeight: 1, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    64
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.7, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    条语音
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F1E8', marginTop: 12, fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                断网也是小侨的声音
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.62, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                同一位发音人，25 MB，跟着程序一起走。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 358, height: 240, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderLeft: '3px solid #A8402F', paddingLeft: 22 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 74, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F1E8', lineHeight: 1, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    3.6
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.7, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    秒
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F1E8', marginTop: 12, fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                从举图到出声
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.62, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                含视觉推理与语音合成。知识库命中的问题，只要 2 毫秒。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 358, height: 240, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderLeft: '3px solid #A8402F', paddingLeft: 22 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 74, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F1E8', lineHeight: 1, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    34
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.7, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    项测试
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F1E8', marginTop: 12, fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                全绿，改一处不崩另一处
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.62, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                音频路由、离线守卫、知识库一致性都有回归保护（另有 3 项联网用例默认跳过）。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.4, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
            侨乡 · 江门 AI 智能讲解员
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.4, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
            11 / 14
        </Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
